## Dimensions
- adequacy:  does the translation preserve all factual content of the source
             (no omission, no hallucination)?
- fluency:   is the translation natural, grammatical, idiomatic in
             {{ target_language }}?
- coherence: does it read coherently in context of the surrounding paragraphs?
- style:     does it match the expected register ({{ register }})?

